eration.5. The waxing of the moon; the augmentation of the luminous part of the moon, presented to the inhabitants of the earth.Seeds, hair, nails, hedges and herbs will grow soonest, if set or cut in the increase of the moon.6. Augmentation of strength or violence; as increase of heat, love or other passion; increase of force.7. Augmentation of degree; as increase of happiness or misery.
